{
  "id": "stolen-voices",
  "title": "STOLEN VOICES",
  "voice": {
    "name": "af_heart",
    "speed": 0.95
  },
  "pace": {
    "lead": 0.2,
    "gap": 0.45,
    "min_beat": 2.4,
    "to_clip": 0.25,
    "after_clip": 0.45,
    "end_pad": 2.0
  },
  "beats": [
    {
      "id": "h01",
      "vo": "A phone rings in a quiet house. Your daughter's voice, crying: mom, I'm in trouble, please don't tell dad.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "the *voice* is hers",
        "hero": {
          "v": "RingingHousePhone",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "dad"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "h02",
      "vo": "Your daughter is fine. She's asleep down the hall. The voice on the phone is still hers. Every crack, every sniff. And it was built by a machine.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "built by a *machine*",
        "hero": {
          "v": "SleepingDoor",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "machine"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a01",
      "vo": "This is a voice clone. And the scary part isn't the tech. It's how little the tech needs.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "how *little* it needs",
        "hero": {
          "v": "WaveThread",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "needs"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a02",
      "vo": "Seconds. That's the length of one story clip where you're laughing at a birthday party. Long enough for a modern model to learn how you sound.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "*seconds* of you",
        "hero": {
          "v": "BirthdayClip",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "sound"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a03",
      "vo": "Here's what that means. The model doesn't store your voice like a tape. It learns your instrument: the pitch, the rasp, the rhythm. Then it plays new words on it.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "it learns your *instrument*",
        "hero": {
          "v": "VoiceLoom",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "words"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a04",
      "vo": "So every voicemail you've left, every video you've posted, every call someone put on speaker: raw material.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "you are the *raw material*",
        "hero": {
          "v": "PostWall",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "material"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a05",
      "vo": "Scammers used to send scripts to strangers. Now they send your own child's voice to you. Consumer agencies have watched family-impersonation fraud climb year after year, and cloning made it personal.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "split",
        "L": {
          "v": "ScriptToVoice",
          "surface": "bare"
        },
        "R": {
          "v": "WaveThread",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "personal"
        },
        "cap": "scripts became *your child*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a06",
      "vo": "You're thinking: easy, hang up, call back. For the grandparent scam, that works. Do that. Always.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "*hang up*, call back",
        "hero": {
          "v": "HangUpHand",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "Always"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a07",
      "vo": "But now think about who else picks up a phone. Your bank. Your boss. A journalist's source.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "split",
        "L": {
          "v": "HangUpHand",
          "surface": "bare"
        },
        "R": {
          "v": "BankCall",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "bank"
        },
        "cap": "who else *picks up*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a08",
      "vo": "In twenty twenty-four, a finance worker at a global firm wired out twenty-five million dollars after a video call with his chief financial officer. Everyone on that call was fake. Everyone but him.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "everyone was *fake*",
        "hero": {
          "v": "VideoCallGrid",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "him"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a09",
      "vo": "And it cuts the other way. Courts, police, newsrooms: they all treat a recording as proof.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "split",
        "L": {
          "v": "GavelTape",
          "surface": "bare"
        },
        "R": {
          "v": "LineIcon",
          "surface": "bare",
          "name": "scale",
          "enter": "proof"
        },
        "cap": "a recording was *proof*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a10",
      "vo": "When anyone can make a recording of anyone saying anything, \"it's on tape\" stops meaning anything. That's the real damage. Not the stolen money. The dead witness.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "the *dead witness*",
        "hero": {
          "v": "Score",
          "sub": "METRIC",
          "label": "TRIGGER",
          "val": "ACTIVE",
          "enter": "witness"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a11",
      "vo": "So here's what works. One: a family password. A silly word only your people know. If the crying voice can't say it, hang up.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "split",
        "L": {
          "v": "FamilyWord",
          "surface": "bare"
        },
        "R": {
          "v": "LineIcon",
          "surface": "bare",
          "name": "lock",
          "enter": "password"
        },
        "cap": "a family *password*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a12",
      "vo": "Two: call back. On the number you already have. A clone can steal your voice. It cannot steal your phone.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "it cannot steal your *phone*",
        "hero": {
          "v": "CallBackDial",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "phone"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a13",
      "vo": "Three: post a little less freely. That birthday clip isn't just a memory anymore. It's a sample.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "split",
        "L": {
          "v": "MemoryToSample",
          "surface": "bare"
        },
        "R": {
          "v": "BirthdayClip",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "sample"
        },
        "cap": "a memory became a *sample*"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a14",
      "vo": "Your voice was always how people knew it was you. Now it's data. And data gets copied.",
      "shot": {
        "layout": "full",
        "cap": "data gets *copied*",
        "hero": {
          "v": "CopiedFace",
          "surface": "bare",
          "enter": "copied"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "master": "v23"
}